OL,3,GNEWSAAirport purchase the best outcome,
OL,4,Asays campaigner
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe founder of a group campaigning to
OL,7,Freopen Doncaster Sheffield Airport
OL,8,F(DSA) has praised plans to bring the
OL,9,Fsite into public ownership as "the best
OL,10,Fthing that they could have done".
OL,12,FIt was announced on Monday that South
OL,13,FYorkshire Mayoral Combined Authority
OL,14,F(SYMCA) was nearing a deal to become
OL,15,Fthe freehold owner, rather than leasing
OL,16,Fthe site from landowner Peel.
OL,18,FMark Chadwick, founder of the group
OL,19,FSave Doncaster Sheffield Airport, said
OL,20,Fhe was "enthusiastic" about the plan,
OL,21,Fhaving campaigned since DSA closed in
OL,22,F2022.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
