OL,3,GNEWSAAirport purchase the best outcome,
OL,4,Asays campaigner
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenior councillors will consider the
OL,7,Fdetails next week, as SYMCA officers
OL,8,Fwarned the project was "not without
OL,9,Frisk to the taxpayer given the sums of
OL,10,Fpublic funding involved".
